  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience and Engagement with Varied Information for a Vibrant Environment (REVIVE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the Action is to contribute to a healthy information environment that enables citizens of Central Asian countries to be resilient to propaganda, mis- and disinformation, and empowered to make informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
